## Summary

This branch adds the ability to list and delete manual reventilations (fixed worklogs) from the UO detail view. It introduces two new API routes (`GET /api/worklogs/fixed` and `DELETE /api/worklogs/fixed/:id`), a new composable (`useFixedWorklogs`), a new `FixedWorklogsSlideover` component, and wires a gear icon into the existing `TimesSection` and `StandardBundleSection` tables. A `hasActiveFixedWorklogs` correlated subquery is added to the worklog aggregation query to drive icon state. The branch also updates the Prettier config.

The feature is functionally sound. The transaction logic for the delete operation is correct and properly recomputes `fixedStatus` after deletion. Three ⚠️ issues identified during review were addressed in follow-up commits: partial-failure UX in the slideover, missing tooltip in `StandardBundleSection`, and dead code removal in `useUo`.

