- `deleteFixedWorklog`: transaction logic is correct — it deletes the row first, then recomputes the remaining sum, then updates `fixedStatus` back to `TO_FIX / PARTIALLY_FIXED / FIXED`. The three-state logic matches the existing `fixWorklog` logic.
