## Cross-cutting Concerns

**Authorization**: Both new API routes rely solely on authentication (any logged-in user can read/delete any fixed worklog by ID or lot O2I). If the application has collaborator-scoped access (e.g., a PM can only see their own lots), an ownership check against `event.context.user` should be added to the DELETE route at minimum.

**Error propagation — `save()` partial failure**: ✅ Fixed — slideover now closes only on full success; on error it stays open and reloads.

**Dead code in `useUo`**: ✅ Fixed — `deleteFixedWorklog` and `deleteFixedWorklogs` removed from `useUo`.

